WEBVTT

00:14.016 --> 00:15.560
The fish soup just came off the stove.

00:15.560 --> 00:16.736
Young Master, give it a try.

00:17.392 --> 00:19.280
The Crown Princess
knows it's your favorite,

00:19.296 --> 00:21.120
so she specially
had this dish prepared for you.

00:21.136 --> 00:22.288
Thank you, Xihe.

00:39.880 --> 00:41.110
Why is it so fishy?

00:42.070 --> 00:43.150
It isn't fishy.

00:43.320 --> 00:44.880
I tasted it just now.

00:44.880 --> 00:46.710
It was fresh and delicious.

01:01.390 --> 01:02.350
You may all leave.

01:06.040 --> 01:06.950
Go bring Mo Yu.

01:26.480 --> 01:28.040
There's no need to examine me.

01:28.040 --> 01:30.310
It's probably just the rainy weather
upsetting my stomach.

01:30.320 --> 01:31.200
It's nothing serious.

01:32.560 --> 01:33.400
Tell the truth.

01:34.430 --> 01:35.680
It's a pregnancy pulse.

01:39.280 --> 01:40.230
How could that be...

01:41.480 --> 01:42.280
Absolutely not.

01:44.040 --> 01:44.950
You may all leave.

01:57.400 --> 01:58.430
Since when?

02:03.000 --> 02:04.350
Not long ago, at the restaurant.

02:05.230 --> 02:06.280
We both got drunk.

02:06.544 --> 02:08.000
Do you have feelings for Cui Jinbai?

02:08.000 --> 02:08.430
No.

02:10.840 --> 02:11.840
It was just an accident.

02:22.190 --> 02:23.150
You were right.

02:28.800 --> 02:30.710
I don't know when I
fell in love with him.

02:31.840 --> 02:33.470
Then do you plan to tell Cui Jinbai?

02:39.840 --> 02:41.590
We were never meant to be together.

02:44.520 --> 02:45.630
So, Xihe,

02:46.784 --> 02:48.640
not only must I keep this from him,

02:49.616 --> 02:52.080
but you must also pretend
you never learned about this.

02:52.512 --> 02:54.208
I don't want to drag you into this.

02:57.910 --> 02:59.150
A child takes

02:59.800 --> 03:00.960
ten full months to carry.

03:02.000 --> 03:03.280
From now on, every single day,

03:04.150 --> 03:06.470
you'll live in constant fear.

03:07.150 --> 03:08.360
No one can guarantee

03:08.430 --> 03:10.150
that both you and the baby will be safe.

03:12.030 --> 03:12.750
I know.

03:14.840 --> 03:16.910
I'll return to Shunan
and secretly give birth there.

03:23.470 --> 03:24.080
That works.

03:25.030 --> 03:26.190
Then let Shen Shijiu

03:26.320 --> 03:28.256
stay in the imperial capital
in your place.

03:28.960 --> 03:30.000
If anything happens,

03:31.520 --> 03:32.630
I'll handle it.

04:55.380 --> 04:56.120
=Blossoms of Power=

04:56.130 --> 04:58.990
(Adapted from the novel, After My
Bloom, All Flowers Wither by Jin Huang)

04:59.060 --> 05:02.020
=Episode 26=

05:03.560 --> 05:04.120
Mo Yuan.

05:04.630 --> 05:05.950
Escort Young Master Bu back.

05:06.448 --> 05:07.664
Yes, Your Highness.

05:28.120 --> 05:29.510
What's wrong with Young Master Bu?

05:29.830 --> 05:31.040
He looks so down.

05:33.600 --> 05:34.240
It's nothing.

05:55.040 --> 05:56.560
At court today,

05:56.750 --> 05:59.430
Cui Jinbai seemed distracted as well.

05:59.504 --> 06:00.600
His mind kept wandering.

06:02.040 --> 06:03.680
He's usually diligent

06:03.680 --> 06:04.680
and decisive.

06:05.168 --> 06:06.870
He rarely loses his composure like this.

06:08.070 --> 06:09.190
So I suspect

06:09.376 --> 06:11.216
something significant must have happened

06:11.360 --> 06:12.630
between him and Young Master Bu.

06:15.296 --> 06:16.800
Then what does Your Highness think

06:17.160 --> 06:18.310
could have happened?

06:21.000 --> 06:22.120
Could it be

06:22.390 --> 06:23.630
that Young Master Bu

06:24.120 --> 06:25.630
is with child

06:25.630 --> 06:26.960
and has nowhere else to turn?

06:35.680 --> 06:36.630
Don't worry, my lady.

06:36.950 --> 06:37.830
Your friend

06:38.390 --> 06:39.480
is my friend, too.

07:11.310 --> 07:12.360
I never expected

07:13.270 --> 07:14.480
you'd ask me to come.

07:16.128 --> 07:17.270
You still wanted to see me?

07:21.360 --> 07:22.680
What did you want to tell me?

07:30.430 --> 07:31.510
I've decided to marry.

07:32.832 --> 07:35.200
The Empress Dowager intends
to arrange a marriage for me.

07:35.310 --> 07:37.800
I'll find a lady who won't expose
my identity and marry her.

07:40.040 --> 07:40.750
Stone Cui,

07:43.000 --> 07:44.430
I truly have feelings for you.

07:48.630 --> 07:49.720
But in this lifetime,

07:51.616 --> 07:54.128
I can only be the Young Master
to the Marquis of Shunan.

08:04.560 --> 08:06.310
I'm telling you how I feel

08:06.600 --> 08:08.270
because I want you to know my decision.

08:08.870 --> 08:09.750
From now on,

08:11.120 --> 08:12.800
don't waste any more time on me.

08:19.616 --> 08:21.328
Let's end this once and for all.

08:21.776 --> 08:23.600
It will be the best outcome
for both of us.

08:33.960 --> 08:35.440
Now that I know how you feel,

08:38.270 --> 08:40.030
if I can't spend my life with you,

08:41.000 --> 08:42.320
I'd rather grow old alone

08:44.360 --> 08:45.630
than be with someone else.

08:47.870 --> 08:48.360
Very well.

08:49.120 --> 08:49.670
As you wish.

08:54.320 --> 08:55.360
This cup of tea

08:58.840 --> 09:00.240
is to sever all ties between us.

09:21.180 --> 09:23.890
♪Time is like a river flowing backward♪

09:23.890 --> 09:26.520
♪The story is sketched anew♪

09:26.520 --> 09:30.160
♪The moonlight
is sewn together by the dusk♪

09:31.610 --> 09:34.380
♪The tide engulfs the lines on my palm♪

09:34.380 --> 09:37.110
♪Pushing me to converge with you♪

09:37.110 --> 09:41.590
♪Sifting for joy in a sea of sorrow♪

09:42.230 --> 09:44.870
♪I step onto this winding path♪

09:44.870 --> 09:47.210
♪What was swept away?♪

09:47.400 --> 09:51.570
♪Joy and sorrow show no emotion♪

09:52.610 --> 09:55.180
♪The clouds twist into a vortex♪

09:55.180 --> 09:57.930
♪Reaching out to touch you♪

09:57.930 --> 10:02.710
♪Only to find it's just a bubble♪

10:05.040 --> 10:09.560
♪I can only stay there forever♪

10:09.560 --> 10:14.860
♪In the coming years, I'll always
remember that year, my graceful lover♪

10:15.010 --> 10:17.480
♪Love hangs on the crest of the waves♪

10:17.730 --> 10:22.160
♪Waiting for regret to swallow me up♪

10:41.270 --> 10:42.870
You need to get more rest now.

10:43.750 --> 10:45.080
You're with child.

10:45.390 --> 10:46.000
Sit down.

10:47.270 --> 10:48.480
I'm fine.

10:55.800 --> 10:57.560
I told you
there was no need to see me off,

10:57.570 --> 10:59.280
yet you insisted on
coming out of the city.

10:59.910 --> 11:01.550
I blended all these incenses for you.

11:05.790 --> 11:08.320
Some repel snakes and insects,
others keep wild beasts away.

11:08.790 --> 11:09.750
And these

11:09.750 --> 11:11.510
are medicinal powders for emergencies,

11:11.720 --> 11:12.870
just in case.

11:19.630 --> 11:20.630
Xihe,

11:24.550 --> 11:25.630
there's something

11:26.384 --> 11:27.910
I've kept to myself all this time.

11:29.600 --> 11:30.390
Today,

11:31.200 --> 11:32.960
I want a straight answer.

11:33.150 --> 11:34.320
Go ahead and ask.

11:35.000 --> 11:36.910
Hesitating doesn't suit you.

11:40.720 --> 11:41.630
Back then,

11:41.840 --> 11:43.790
you had Shen Shijiu imitate me

11:44.960 --> 11:46.360
because one day

11:47.296 --> 11:49.840
you intended for him
to take my place, didn't you?

11:51.000 --> 11:52.240
I did consider it.

11:54.390 --> 11:55.480
As long as I died,

11:55.840 --> 11:58.630
Shen Shijiu could take my token
and pass himself off as me,

11:58.704 --> 12:00.736
becoming the Young Master
to the Marquis of Shunan.

12:00.740 --> 12:02.590
Then you would have control
of the Shunan army.

12:04.790 --> 12:06.030
Becoming a mother

12:07.030 --> 12:08.270
really has made you wiser.

12:11.200 --> 12:12.360
Court politics

12:12.432 --> 12:14.320
are all about fighting
over military power.

12:14.496 --> 12:15.600
That's how it should seem.

12:15.910 --> 12:17.630
Then why didn't you do it?

12:19.630 --> 12:20.960
Because you're my closest friend.

12:27.200 --> 12:29.870
I want the Duke of Wei's Manor
to stand as firm as a fortress,

12:30.440 --> 12:31.030
but not

12:31.030 --> 12:32.910
at the cost of my closest friend's life.

12:40.910 --> 12:42.030
Since I was nine,

12:42.032 --> 12:44.272
when I came to
the imperial capital as a hostage,

12:44.790 --> 12:46.600
I've been surrounded by enemies,

12:47.270 --> 12:49.120
alone and constantly on guard.

12:49.910 --> 12:51.790
I never dared hope or expect

12:52.840 --> 12:54.120
to have a true friend.

12:56.670 --> 12:57.510
Xihe,

12:58.208 --> 12:59.856
for the friendship you've given me,

13:00.000 --> 13:01.712
all I can offer is my deepest gratitude.

13:02.240 --> 13:03.120
I'll never forget it.

13:08.790 --> 13:09.360
By the way...

13:12.960 --> 13:13.750
Open it.

13:40.240 --> 13:41.390
It's beautiful.

13:42.080 --> 13:42.910
Xihe,

13:44.320 --> 13:45.480
would you give it to me?

13:46.240 --> 13:46.960
No.

13:47.960 --> 13:49.120
If I gave it to you,

13:49.360 --> 13:50.840
you'd be tempted to sneak it on.

13:51.840 --> 13:53.000
One careless mistake

13:53.072 --> 13:55.520
would be a capital offense
for deceiving the Emperor.

14:09.270 --> 14:10.270
I was thinking

14:10.630 --> 14:11.550
that on your journey,

14:12.112 --> 14:14.832
you might run into someone who
recognizes you in your male disguise.

14:15.150 --> 14:17.270
You'll be safer
traveling in ladies' clothing.

14:20.510 --> 14:22.270
You've always thought
of everything for me.

14:26.240 --> 14:27.550
When we first formed our alliance,

14:27.680 --> 14:29.240
you promised me 3,000 elite soldiers.

14:30.320 --> 14:31.840
And now those 3,000 elite soldiers

14:32.630 --> 14:33.910
have been exchanged for a dress.

14:34.910 --> 14:35.910
Looking at it that way,

14:35.952 --> 14:37.030
I'd say I came out ahead.

14:43.750 --> 14:45.240
After your child is born,

14:45.296 --> 14:47.968
don't think you can simply settle
for a life in the household.

14:49.080 --> 14:50.150
What do you mean?

14:51.150 --> 14:52.510
I know what you aspire to.

14:53.320 --> 14:54.150
One day,

14:54.960 --> 14:56.510
I'll see you clad in armor and raise

14:57.630 --> 14:59.790
the crimson banner as a lady,

15:00.320 --> 15:02.080
becoming the first
female military marquis

15:02.144 --> 15:04.448
to ride into battle in the past
300 years of this dynasty.

15:04.640 --> 15:05.910
I'll have the court historians

15:06.390 --> 15:07.910
rewrite the pages of history for you

15:08.032 --> 15:10.200
and engrave your name
upon the general's seal.

15:26.630 --> 15:27.480
Take care of yourself.

15:44.000 --> 15:46.230
Your Highness summoned me
to the palace so late at night.

15:46.240 --> 15:47.504
Has something urgent happened?

15:47.750 --> 15:48.600
Jinbai,

15:50.200 --> 15:51.750
there's something I must tell you.

15:52.688 --> 15:54.480
Young Master Bu is on her way to Shunan

15:55.080 --> 15:56.080
via Minzhou.

15:56.544 --> 15:59.550
Shen Shijiu has remained at the Marquis
of Shunan's Residence in her place.

16:10.448 --> 16:11.910
This is a pass to leave the city.

16:12.240 --> 16:13.630
The imperial capital or Shunan,

16:14.390 --> 16:15.550
I'll let you choose.

16:21.760 --> 16:23.984
My lord, something important
has come up.

16:24.992 --> 16:26.790
Although I saw it
with my own eyes last time,

16:26.870 --> 16:28.080
that Bu Shulin was a man,

16:28.510 --> 16:30.120
I still felt something was off.

16:30.440 --> 16:32.200
So I had people
keep watch on the servants

16:32.200 --> 16:34.510
going in and out
of the Marquis of Shunan's Residence.

16:34.510 --> 16:36.080
Did you discover something, my lady?

16:41.440 --> 16:42.150
Atractylodes,

16:42.750 --> 16:43.550
peony,

16:44.510 --> 16:45.390
and scutellaria.

16:45.790 --> 16:46.600
What they were buying

16:47.024 --> 16:48.928
was a prescription
to protect a pregnancy.

16:50.630 --> 16:52.840
Bu Shulin really is a lady.

16:53.600 --> 16:54.910
At the birthday banquet,

16:55.870 --> 16:57.120
she used a stand-in.

16:59.080 --> 16:59.670
Your Highness,

16:59.920 --> 17:01.990
we've learned that Bu Shulin
suddenly left the city

17:02.200 --> 17:03.240
and headed toward Minzhou.

17:06.720 --> 17:08.440
Now everything makes sense.

17:08.960 --> 17:10.920
The answer lies in this prescription.

17:11.920 --> 17:14.110
She's carrying a child,

17:14.976 --> 17:17.792
which is why she couldn't remain
in the imperial capital any longer.

17:17.920 --> 17:19.830
Dispatch our most elite men

17:20.440 --> 17:21.790
at once to capture Bu Shulin.

17:21.936 --> 17:23.232
Yes, Your Highness.

17:25.540 --> 17:30.340
(Yanbo Pier)

18:00.400 --> 18:00.960
Miss,

18:00.960 --> 18:02.400
our boat will arrive in two hours.

18:27.180 --> 18:30.620
(Yanbo Pier)

20:50.480 --> 20:51.350
I'm sorry I'm late.

21:04.110 --> 21:04.720
Does it hurt?

21:06.400 --> 21:07.030
Not really.

21:07.590 --> 21:08.880
They're only superficial wounds.

21:33.790 --> 21:35.790
I know I'm quite beautiful,

21:36.400 --> 21:38.688
but surely I'm not worth
staring at for this long.

21:42.350 --> 21:43.550
That's enough.

21:47.480 --> 21:49.070
All the countless times I imagined

21:50.576 --> 21:52.560
this moment couldn't
compare to even a fraction

21:53.790 --> 21:54.680
of seeing you today.

21:58.176 --> 22:00.096
Now that the bandits
have been eliminated,

22:00.784 --> 22:02.720
I'll set off as soon
as the boat arrives.

22:03.000 --> 22:04.400
Once I enter Shunan,

22:04.920 --> 22:06.510
someone will be there to meet me.

22:09.000 --> 22:09.750
Vice Minister Cui,

22:11.790 --> 22:12.590
you should go back.

22:13.830 --> 22:14.310
I can't.

22:15.310 --> 22:16.160
I'm going with you.

22:16.256 --> 22:18.830
As one of the Emperor's
closest officials, your promising future

22:19.790 --> 22:20.830
will be gone

22:21.680 --> 22:23.070
from this day on.

22:23.200 --> 22:24.416
Do you have no regrets?

22:26.400 --> 22:27.400
I know in my heart

22:27.744 --> 22:29.936
that you're more important
than any of that.

22:33.830 --> 22:35.160
I'll always remember

22:35.640 --> 22:36.680
your feelings for me.

22:38.440 --> 22:40.350
But the price you're paying
is simply too great.

22:44.000 --> 22:45.070
You should go back.

22:45.728 --> 22:47.070
Just pretend you never saw me.

22:48.640 --> 22:49.960
The road to Shunan

22:51.120 --> 22:52.416
is one I want to walk alone.

22:55.640 --> 22:57.110
Even if you refuse to marry me,

22:59.072 --> 23:01.632
I'll stay by the side of the person
who means the most to me

23:02.790 --> 23:03.680
and never leave.

23:10.790 --> 23:11.880
My heart

23:13.590 --> 23:14.480
will never waver.

23:20.270 --> 23:21.830
I spend money recklessly,

23:22.590 --> 23:24.350
drink, gamble, and fool around all day.

23:24.624 --> 23:26.704
I've long been used
to living without restraint.

23:26.800 --> 23:28.310
I've never been the settling-down type.

23:28.510 --> 23:29.920
Do whatever you want.

23:29.920 --> 23:30.880
- If you're happy...
- I don't even know

23:30.880 --> 23:32.200
how to be a proper young lady,

23:32.528 --> 23:34.110
let alone a virtuous wife and mother.

23:34.110 --> 23:35.790
I can take care of the household
and raise our children.

23:35.790 --> 23:37.200
I command thousands of soldiers.

23:37.440 --> 23:38.550
Once I'm away on campaign,

23:38.896 --> 23:40.640
I may not return home
for months at a time.

23:40.650 --> 23:41.680
You'll be left home alone.

23:41.680 --> 23:42.240
I'll go with you...

23:42.240 --> 23:42.920
Cui Jinbai,

23:45.790 --> 23:46.830
have you ever thought

23:48.400 --> 23:50.310
that even if we become husband and wife,

23:51.880 --> 23:54.000
before the world, I can only be a man?

24:02.790 --> 24:03.790
With me,

24:06.830 --> 24:08.310
you can always be yourself.

24:13.270 --> 24:14.000
Bu Shulin,

24:15.200 --> 24:16.310
I'm in love with you.

24:18.880 --> 24:19.920
Let me go with you.

24:21.350 --> 24:22.000
Will you?

24:55.720 --> 24:57.240
You're lying on our baby.

25:09.640 --> 25:12.070
Since you're such a learned scholar,

25:12.310 --> 25:13.310
why don't you

25:14.830 --> 25:16.400
give our child a name?

25:21.820 --> 25:25.420
(East Palace)

25:28.350 --> 25:30.480
I've completely
rooted out Changmin's forces.

25:32.030 --> 25:32.960
There'll be no one left

25:32.960 --> 25:34.480
to threaten their lives.

25:36.272 --> 25:38.976
Cui Jinbai went to Minzhou under
the pretext of investigating a case.

25:39.000 --> 25:39.880
He'll probably

25:40.200 --> 25:41.400
be gone for about six months.

25:41.664 --> 25:43.744
He'll stay with Bu Shulin
until the baby is born.

25:44.110 --> 25:46.510
Cui Jinbai has been the officer
you've groomed for years.

25:47.350 --> 25:48.510
Given enough time,

25:48.576 --> 25:50.752
he was destined
to rise to the highest office.

25:51.160 --> 25:53.830
Can you really bear
to let him retire to the countryside?

25:54.720 --> 25:55.880
The old me

25:56.000 --> 25:57.240
certainly couldn't.

26:00.960 --> 26:01.880
But for some reason,

26:02.750 --> 26:03.510
this time,

26:05.360 --> 26:07.248
I'd rather help them
find their happiness.

26:13.830 --> 26:16.310
I've gone to such great lengths for you.

26:17.790 --> 26:19.030
Won't you reward me?

26:30.030 --> 26:31.590
I remember my promise.

26:32.750 --> 26:34.070
Everything I've done

26:34.640 --> 26:35.960
has been of my own free will.

26:36.368 --> 26:38.070
Even if my feelings are never returned,

26:38.590 --> 26:39.680
I won't resent you.

26:41.480 --> 26:43.160
I'll just be quietly

26:43.720 --> 26:45.350
sad for a little while.

26:48.030 --> 26:49.400
There you go again.

26:52.200 --> 26:53.310
You've worked hard.

26:54.310 --> 26:56.790
Thank you for protecting Lin

26:56.896 --> 26:58.550
and bringing these two lovers together.

27:06.368 --> 27:07.680
Whatever Youyou wishes for

27:08.350 --> 27:09.510
is all I could ever ask.

27:12.440 --> 27:14.110
You're smiling more and more these days.

27:15.200 --> 27:16.720
What could be more precious than that?

27:19.720 --> 27:20.720
For as long as I live,

27:21.936 --> 27:23.216
I'm always at your service.

27:36.640 --> 27:37.720
Bu Shulin's affair

27:37.824 --> 27:39.030
was supposed to be foolproof.

27:39.888 --> 27:41.680
Prince Ning has proven utterly useless.

27:42.480 --> 27:43.960
Please don't blame me.

27:44.224 --> 27:46.370
Prince Ning has completely
alienated the East Palace.

27:46.550 --> 27:47.590
He's a spent force now.

27:48.030 --> 27:49.790
But I'm willing
to give everything for you.

27:49.960 --> 27:51.264
I'll do whatever you ask.

28:01.376 --> 28:03.296
This is the poison
from the foreign merchant?

28:07.680 --> 28:09.240
I know what to do.

28:25.240 --> 28:26.590
What are you doing here?

28:26.656 --> 28:28.200
Someone from the palace came to inquire

28:28.480 --> 28:30.510
why Second Prince
hasn't attended court for days

28:30.510 --> 28:31.830
or gone to the Censorate.

28:32.000 --> 28:33.310
Has something happened?

28:33.960 --> 28:35.550
You aren't receiving visitors.

28:35.560 --> 28:37.232
So I took the liberty
of deciding for you.

28:37.310 --> 28:38.750
I told them you were ill

28:38.960 --> 28:40.480
and needed a few days' rest.

28:41.270 --> 28:41.960
Very well.

28:42.920 --> 28:43.920
I understand.

28:46.240 --> 28:47.480
It's only noon.

28:47.750 --> 28:50.160
Yet you are already
drinking and making merry.

28:50.550 --> 28:51.880
This is beneath your dignity.

28:52.920 --> 28:54.680
Please dismiss the foreign dancer.

28:55.160 --> 28:56.440
Once you've sobered up,

28:57.030 --> 28:58.680
we can discuss this at length.

28:59.270 --> 29:00.790
Discuss this at length?

29:03.720 --> 29:06.270
What future do I have left?

29:09.550 --> 29:11.110
No wonder you're no match for them.

29:25.550 --> 29:26.750
What did you say?

29:29.350 --> 29:30.240
I said,

29:30.880 --> 29:33.070
victory and defeat
are the fortunes of war.

29:34.440 --> 29:35.830
After a single defeat,

29:36.160 --> 29:37.750
you've become nothing but a beaten cur,

29:37.808 --> 29:39.648
drifting through your days
in a drunken haze.

29:40.440 --> 29:43.310
Had I known Prince Ning
was so weak and incompetent,

29:43.720 --> 29:44.830
so unfit for great things,

29:45.160 --> 29:46.680
I never should have married you.

29:49.270 --> 29:51.110
Your ability
doesn't match your ambition.

29:51.216 --> 29:52.736
It will only bring disaster upon you.

29:53.270 --> 29:54.200
Have you lost your mind?

29:54.640 --> 29:56.960
How dare you insult His Highness
with such insolence!

30:03.160 --> 30:05.720
If you want to become a lowly courtesan
passed from man to man,

30:06.110 --> 30:07.680
then go ahead and say one more word.

30:09.070 --> 30:10.110
I'll kill you!

30:15.000 --> 30:16.240
Have you had enough?

30:19.510 --> 30:20.920
Consumed by jealousy and spite.

30:21.040 --> 30:22.480
Your words are utterly disgraceful.

30:22.480 --> 30:24.440
Have you no regard for royal dignity?

30:41.960 --> 30:43.310
Lin returned safely to Shunan.

30:44.208 --> 30:45.880
Prince Ning's elite force has been lost.

30:46.400 --> 30:47.590
Every plan he laid

30:47.920 --> 30:49.270
ended in complete defeat.

30:50.200 --> 30:51.350
At any rate,

30:51.790 --> 30:52.960
we can't count on him anymore.

30:53.960 --> 30:55.310
That's why Gu Qingshu

30:55.830 --> 30:57.510
decided to get out
while she still could.

31:00.736 --> 31:02.528
Even a vicious tiger
won't kill its own cubs.

31:03.270 --> 31:05.880
Few men could bring themselves

31:06.550 --> 31:08.000
to harm the child in their womb.

31:24.350 --> 31:25.400
You're here.

31:43.400 --> 31:44.160
Your Highness.

31:44.790 --> 31:46.000
Too much liquor is bad for you.

31:47.030 --> 31:48.070
This is the hangover soup

31:48.440 --> 31:50.240
I prepared for you myself.

31:51.590 --> 31:54.030
That day, I was blinded by anger.

31:55.160 --> 31:56.240
I never imagined

31:57.550 --> 31:59.030
it would kill our child.

32:11.880 --> 32:14.270
You abandoned this child long ago.

32:15.960 --> 32:16.960
And me.

32:18.960 --> 32:20.510
Why would you say such a thing?

32:20.848 --> 32:22.680
As husband and wife,
we are of one heart.

32:22.960 --> 32:25.270
You mean more to me than anyone else.

32:33.200 --> 32:33.960
I believe you.

32:48.270 --> 32:51.160
No one has ever truly cared about me.

32:51.400 --> 32:53.000
Everyone says

32:53.070 --> 32:55.000
I was never meant to be Emperor.

32:55.830 --> 32:58.030
I've worked harder than anyone else.

32:58.680 --> 33:00.960
So why has everything

33:02.160 --> 33:03.960
turned against me?

33:16.400 --> 33:18.270
I couldn't even

33:22.350 --> 33:23.720
protect our child.

33:49.550 --> 33:50.680
Qingshu.

33:52.400 --> 33:53.640
Qingshu.

34:04.590 --> 34:06.400
You're ruthless.

34:08.230 --> 34:10.190
That encounter at Ningchun Garden,

34:10.880 --> 34:12.360
and Hu Yingrao's death,

34:13.360 --> 34:15.030
were both your doing, weren't they?

34:18.280 --> 34:19.110
Your Highness.

34:26.150 --> 34:27.440
All my life,

34:29.360 --> 34:31.590
what I've hated most
is being looked down on

34:32.760 --> 34:33.880
and abandoned.

34:35.190 --> 34:36.480
I thought

34:36.880 --> 34:38.840
I'd hate you to the core.

34:40.960 --> 34:42.590
But your ruthlessness,

34:43.880 --> 34:46.320
your determination to stop at nothing,

34:47.664 --> 34:49.670
has left me with no choice
but to admire you.

34:51.360 --> 34:53.510
What right do I have to hate you?

34:56.630 --> 34:58.480
I even hope

35:00.110 --> 35:02.150
you'll carry on in my place.

35:43.710 --> 35:44.710
Once I'm dead,

35:46.110 --> 35:48.400
you'll be able to give
the one behind you

35:49.230 --> 35:50.360
an answer.

35:51.110 --> 35:52.840
I've cared about my dignity all my life.

35:53.190 --> 35:55.360
Since I can't fulfill my own ambitions,

35:55.480 --> 35:56.550
I'd rather

35:59.230 --> 36:00.840
help my wife fulfill hers.

36:28.630 --> 36:29.840
The law

36:32.880 --> 36:36.400
is upheld alike
by the Son of Heaven and all his people.

36:36.496 --> 36:38.656
(Imperial Code Commentary)
From the Three Excellencies

36:38.656 --> 36:39.630
and Nine Ministers above

36:39.630 --> 36:42.480
to the common people below,

36:42.920 --> 36:43.880
all must

36:44.880 --> 36:46.800
stand in awe of the law.

36:55.200 --> 36:57.190
Only by governing
with both virtue and punishment

36:58.110 --> 36:59.960
can order prevail.

37:00.320 --> 37:02.030
Only when rites and law are in harmony

37:03.110 --> 37:05.280
can lasting peace endure.

37:53.008 --> 37:54.832
Your Highness, what are you doing here?

37:54.840 --> 37:56.140
You wouldn't let me come with you,

37:56.150 --> 37:57.990
yet you had Changqing
protect you all the way.

37:58.030 --> 37:58.800
I just...

38:01.670 --> 38:02.630
Prince Xin!

38:03.150 --> 38:05.320
Some people are always so stubborn,

38:05.440 --> 38:06.510
so distracted.

38:06.590 --> 38:07.800
I have plenty of time.

38:07.800 --> 38:08.760
But you, Crown Prince,

38:09.110 --> 38:10.230
your days are numbered.

38:14.750 --> 38:17.690
♪I've hidden so many words♪

38:18.310 --> 38:21.110
♪Too reluctant to tell you♪

38:21.980 --> 38:28.950
♪So never uncover♪

38:29.140 --> 38:31.500
♪The sand that slips away
with one grasp♪

38:32.630 --> 38:35.360
♪The flower that withers
after one bloom♪

38:36.320 --> 38:41.660
♪Silently buried deep inside my heart♪

38:43.420 --> 38:46.240
♪Every answer I gave♪

38:47.040 --> 38:49.890
♪Was both bittersweet and absurd♪

38:50.680 --> 38:54.050
♪Hiding my tear-filled eyes
when I hurt you♪

38:54.310 --> 38:57.620
♪How hard it truly was?♪

39:00.590 --> 39:04.030
♪The wounds that healed
with just a little comfort♪

39:05.020 --> 39:07.350
♪The lies made whole
with a single embrace♪

39:08.620 --> 39:14.380
♪Pretending to be brave
as if I'd never been hurt♪

39:15.790 --> 39:18.920
♪It's a shame I never could♪

39:19.370 --> 39:22.380
♪Give you a moon in return♪

39:22.490 --> 39:29.130
♪With the same open heart you loved me♪

39:29.130 --> 39:32.800
♪I've crossed the wasteland of memories♪

39:33.670 --> 39:36.430
♪Never knowing I was lost♪

39:36.870 --> 39:40.000
♪Why don't you take me away?♪

39:40.440 --> 39:46.390
♪Lead me out of this endless game
of hide-and-seek♪

39:47.790 --> 39:51.340
♪You'll never♪

39:51.620 --> 40:01.090
♪Know how much I long to, long to♪

40:27.260 --> 40:30.740
(No animals were harmed
in the making of this film)
